Subject: [PATCH] The logarithmic bound by the binary length: one lemma in
 Basic

logSpace_le_size_succ moves from Logspace/ISCountMath to SpaceComplexity/Basic, beside
logSpace_le_succ (statement and proof unchanged). BPLInP's two_pow_codes_le and BPL_subset_P,
which re-derived it inline, and SpaceAmplifyPoly's logSpace_le_ell now cite it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
